\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Christ for the world, we sing:
\par The world to Christ we bring
\par With loving zeal;
\par The poor, and them that mourn,
\par The faint and overborne,
\par Sin-sick and sorrow-worn,
\par Whom Christ doth heal.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Christ for the world, we sing:
\par The world to Christ we bring
\par With fervent prayer,
\par The wayward and the lost,
\par By restless passions tossed,
\par Redeemed at countless cost
\par From dark despair.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Christ for the world, we sing:
\par The world to Christ we bring
\par With one accord;
\par With us the work to share,
\par With us reproach to dare,
\par With us the cross to bear
\par For Christ our Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Christ for the world, we sing:
\par The world to Christ we bring
\par With joyful song;
\par The new-born souls, whose days,
\par Reclaimed from error's ways,
\par Inpired with hope and praise,
\par To Christ belong.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

